text = "There are three types of cards in this game:

1.		Monsters (spades and clubs)

2.		Weapons (diamonds)

3. 	Potions (hearts"

[node name="Page2" type="Node2D" parent="Pages"]
visible = false

[node name="RulesBody2" type="RichTextLabel" parent="Pages/Page2"]
offset_left = 250.0
offset_top = 193.0
offset_right = 1250.0
offset_bottom = 678.0
theme_override_colors/default_color = Color(0.63, 0.63, 0.63, 1)
theme_override_font_sizes/normal_font_size = 24
text = "Monsters deal damage equal to their power

Jacks are 11
Queens are 12
Kings are 13
Aces are 14
"

[node name="Page3" type="Node2D" parent="Pages"]
visible = false

[node name="RulesBody3" type="RichTextLabel" parent="Pages/Page3"]
offset_left = 250.0
offset_top = 193.0
offset_right = 1250.0
offset_bottom = 678.0
theme_override_colors/default_color = Color(0.63, 0.63, 0.63, 1)
theme_override_font_sizes/normal_font_size = 24
text = "Weapons block damage equal to their card value.

When you face a monster, you can choose to either block with a weapon or take the damage.

Monsters blocked with weapons are attached to the weapon.

A weapon can only block a monster with lesser power than the last monster it blocked. 

You can only have one weapon, so playing another weapon puts your current weapon and all monsters attached into the discard pile. "

[node name="Page4" type="Node2D" parent="Pages"]
visible = false

[node name="RulesBody4" type="RichTextLabel" parent="Pages/Page4"]
offset_left = 250.0
offset_top = 193.0
offset_right = 1250.0
offset_bottom = 678.0
theme_override_colors/default_color = Color(0.63, 0.63, 0.63, 1)
theme_override_font_sizes/normal_font_size = 24
text = "Postions restore health equal to their card value, to a maximum health of 20."

[node name="Page5" type="Node2D" parent="Pages"]
visible = false

[node name="RulesBody5" type="RichTextLabel" parent="Pages/Page5"]
offset_left = 250.0
offset_top = 193.0
offset_right = 1250.0
offset_bottom = 678.0
theme_override_colors/default_color = Color(0.63, 0.63, 0.63, 1)
theme_override_font_sizes/normal_font_size = 24
text = "Rooms consists of four cards.

Players can either choose to face the room or skip it. 

If a player faces a room, they must play three cards from that room to advance to the next one. 

Rooms cannot be skipped twice in a row."

[node name="Page6" type="Node2D" parent="Pages"]
visible = false

[node name="RulesBody6" type="RichTextLabel" parent="Pages/Page6"]
offset_left = 250.0
offset_top = 193.0
offset_right = 1250.0
offset_bottom = 678.0
theme_override_colors/default_color = Color(0.63, 0.63, 0.63, 1)
theme_override_font_sizes/normal_font_size = 24
text = "Players start at a health of 20. 

Once there are no longer enough cards in the deck to create a new room, the game is over and the player has won.

If the player's health goes to zero, they lose the game. 


Good Luck!"

